<ModMetaData>
	<name>Project Mamono Insects</name>
	<author>Gapho</author>
	<supportedVersions>
		<li>1.6</li>
	</supportedVersions>
	<packageId>PMM.Insects</packageId>
	<description>
Adds sixteen insect mamonos to RimWorld 1.6, and two tribes of their own to live in.

Sixteen insect mamono castes live in the world: builders, diggers, farmers, weavers, soldiers and queens. Two insector tribes hold villages grown from hive walls and creep, one neutral and trading and one always at war. The Abaddon Queen can lay an egg of any of the mamono added in this pack.

In game you meet them as raiders, as trade caravans, as villages to exterminate, or as mamono you take in. Each mamono is good at something.

Requires Harmony, Biotech, Project Mamono, Big and Small - Framework, Vanilla Expanded Framework, Vanilla Races Expanded - Insector, and Vanilla Factions Expanded - Insectoids 2.
	</description>
